IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc5-o21-appendix`

-- TESTS for roc5-o21-appendix.l4 (Order 21 rule 10 and Appendix 1).  Every expected value is written from the
-- text of the Appendix (lines 3133 to 3378 of the raw file), beside the assertion, before the module was run.
-- The converter flattened the tables: each row is read as the three cells that follow it (High Court, District
-- Court, Magistrate's Court).

§ `Tests -- Order 21 rule 10 and Appendix 1`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 10`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 21 r 10 the amount of costs allowed is the amount set out in Appendix 1` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- unless the Court otherwise orders
#ASSERT `o 21 r 10 the amount of costs allowed is the amount set out in Appendix 1` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 r 10 the amount of costs allowed is the amount set out in Appendix 1` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 r 10 the amount of costs allowed is the amount set out in Appendix 1` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `The column for a court level`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 the column for the court level` `General Division` EQUALS JUST `o 21 app 1 the High Court`
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 the column for the court level` `District Court` EQUALS JUST `o 21 app 1 a District Court`
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 the column for the court level` `Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST `o 21 app 1 a Magistrate's Court`
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 the column for the court level` `Appellate Division` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 the column for the court level` `Family Division` EQUALS NOTHING

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Part 1 -- paragraph 1`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(b) the claimant obtains final judgment in default of a notice of intention to contest or not contest or in default of defence` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(i) the claimant obtains final judgment under Order 9, Rule 17 unconditionally` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(ii) the Court dismisses an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(iii) the Court gives the defendant unconditional permission to defend an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a case the paragraph does not list: not covered
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1 another case` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- para 1(2): damages to be assessed -- this Part does not apply
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- para 1(2): relief of the nature in Order 52 rule 1
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` FALSE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Order 52 rule 1 has not answered
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` FALSE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(1) the scale of costs in Part 2 applies to the case` `o 21 app 1 para 1 another case` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(b) the claimant obtains final judgment in default of a notice of intention to contest or not contest or in default of defence` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(a) the defendant pays the amount claimed within the time and in the manner required by the endorsement of the originating claim` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(b) the claimant obtains final judgment in default of a notice of intention to contest or not contest or in default of defence` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- only the cases in 1(1)(a) and (b)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(i) the claimant obtains final judgment under Order 9, Rule 17 unconditionally` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 1(3) the scale of costs and disbursements in both Parts 2 and 3 applies` `o 21 app 1 para 1 another case` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

