#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(i) the claimant obtains final judgment under Order 9, Rule 17 unconditionally` `o 21 app 1 the High Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 4000 15000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(i) the claimant obtains final judgment under Order 9, Rule 17 unconditionally` `o 21 app 1 a District Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 3000 10000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(i) the claimant obtains final judgment under Order 9, Rule 17 unconditionally` `o 21 app 1 a Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 2000 6000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(ii) the Court dismisses an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 the High Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 4000 15000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(ii) the Court dismisses an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 a District Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 3000 10000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(ii) the Court dismisses an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 a Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 2000 6000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(iii) the Court gives the defendant unconditional permission to defend an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 the High Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 4000 15000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(iii) the Court gives the defendant unconditional permission to defend an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 a District Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 3000 10000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1(1)(c)(iii) the Court gives the defendant unconditional permission to defend an application for summary judgment under Order 9, Rule 17` `o 21 app 1 a Magistrate's Court` EQUALS JUST (`o 21 app 1 a range` 2000 6000)
#ASSERT `o 21 app 1 para 2 the costs to be allowed excluding disbursements` `o 21 app 1 para 1 another case` `o 21 app 1 the High Court` EQUALS NOTHING

